     sseemm__ddeessttrrooyy — destroy an unnamed semaphore

LLIIBBRRAARRYY
     Standard C Library (libc, -lc)

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ##iinncclluuddee <<sseemmaapphhoorree..hh>>

